  "details": "Adding a message system would be beneficial for Many reasons, \n\n#1, You can talk to friends who are not in the same world as you.\n\n#2, Some people do not have social media/are not comfortable giving it out since anyone can hear you say it, and yes you can go to a private world and say it there but that takes up time and is a huge inconvenience when you could just text them it. \n\n#3 If a VR person needs to massage someone in the game they either have to angle their head up and look down at their device, or take their headset off and text them, which can cause them to disconnect.\n\n #4 Its a social game, and one of the only chat games that does not have a private messaging system. \n\nTL;DR Add messaging system",
